# Run artifacts: the raw per-task trace is large and deterministically regenerable
# (run = pure function of its coordinates), so it is a local cache — gitignored. The
# small summary.json + library.json under each runs/<id>/ ARE committed (the durable,
# self-contained record). See src/arc_lab/solvers/dsl/analysis/artifact.py.
runs/*/trace.jsonl

